1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:01,308
If a Target price

2
00:00:01,308 --> 00:00:02,811
drops before Dec 24,

3
00:00:03,291 --> 00:00:04,578
you get the difference back.

4
00:00:04,758 --> 00:00:07,082
Normally it's just 14 days. So why?

5
00:00:07,362 --> 00:00:09,668
Guess! Whose lower price does Target match?

6
00:00:12,068 --> 00:00:13,012
Only its own!

7
00:00:13,292 --> 00:00:15,945
The stakes? Its last holiday quarter

8
00:00:15,945 --> 00:00:18,450
brought in $30.5 billion in sales.

9
00:00:18,930 --> 00:00:21,061
About 29¢ of every $1

10
00:00:21,061 --> 00:00:23,394
it sold in fiscal 2025!

11
00:00:23,674 --> 00:00:25,090
So until Dec 24, you

12
00:00:25,090 --> 00:00:27,071
get the difference back, but

13
00:00:27,071 --> 00:00:29,053
only on Target's own prices!

